<title>HUNGARY: Hungary int'l reserves steady at $9.8 bln in Dec.</title>
<headline>Hungary int'l reserves steady at $9.8 bln in Dec.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's international reserves stood at $9.8 billion at the end of December, unchanged from November, according to preliminary figures, the National Bank of Hungary said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
